Package: llmCoder
Title: Automated Mixed-Methods Coding with Large Language Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("B.", "Osangir", email = "b.osangir@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Applies a qualitative codebook to text with large language models
    via 'ellmer' structured output, then links the resulting theme codes to
    participants' quantitative metadata. Tests and visualises whether metric
    values differ when a theme is present, bridging qualitative coding and
    quantitative analysis in one workflow.
